          <choice_text>$\frac{b}{a}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>b/a이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{a}{b^2}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳지 않다.</commentary>
